{"a":[48,48],"h":"<p>48.<svg class=\"ea\" width=\"89\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 89.0 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.4 27.0 35.2 35.2 42.7 51.0 51.0 57.7 64.4\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.4 57.7 64.4 72.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> bir de derler ki <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"141\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 140.8 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 16.6 25.6 25.6 34.6 42.7 42.7 50.3 66.0 72.7 81.7 81.7 99.7 111.0 111.0 117.7\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"34.6 72.7 117.7 124.6\" y=\"26.3\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> ne zaman bu va'd - bu ölülerin dirilmesi, bu ıhzar va'di <svg class=\"ea\" width=\"154\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 153.6 40.4\"><text x=\"3.0 16.6 27.0 33.7 33.7 40.6 40.6 48.0 54.7 77.3 77.3 86.3 86.3 93.0 93.0 99.7 99.7 120.0 120.0 130.6 130.6\" y=\"25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3 25.4 26.3 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 25.4 26.3\" class=\"A3\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text><text x=\"16.6 54.7 137.3\" y=\"25.4\" class=\"A3b\" font-size=\"20.2\"></text></svg> eğer doğru iseniz - ya'ni böyle diyerek istihza etmek isterler. 49. </p>"}